# 4. Assistant entry points

## `/app/assistant` hoặc `/app/tasks`

Trang chính của Assistant nên là **My Tasks**.

Các nhóm task:

```txt
Assigned
In progress
Needs revision
Submitted
Waiting final approval
Completed
Rejected / Cancelled
```

Thông tin mỗi task card:

```txt
Task type
Series title
Chapter number
Page / Region target
Deadline
Priority
Status
Last feedback
CTA chính
```

CTA theo status:

```txt
TODO → Start task
IN_PROGRESS → Continue work
REVISION_REQUESTED → Revise submission
SUBMITTED → View submitted work
MANGAKA_APPROVED → Waiting editor review
EDITOR_APPROVED → View completed task
REJECTED → View result
CANCELLED → View cancelled task
```

