# 11. Assistant Task Studio

Task Studio là workspace chính của Assistant.

## `/app/tasks/$id/studio`

Màn hình nên có:

```txt
Task Header
- Task type
- Status badge
- Series / Chapter / Page reference
- Deadline
- Assignee = current assistant

Context Panel
- Page/Region preview
- Instructions
- Reference files
- Previous feedback

Work Area
- Upload work file
- Add note
- Save draft
- Submit

Submission History
- v1, v2, v3...
- status
- submittedAt
- feedback
```

## Task Studio gate

Assistant chỉ mở Task Studio khi:

```txt
task.assigneeId === currentUser.id
```

Nếu không:

```txt
403 Forbidden
→ You do not have access to this task.
```

Nếu task cancelled:

```txt
This task has been cancelled.
```

Nếu task completed:

```txt
This task is final approved.
View-only mode.
```

