# 12. Submit work flow

## Assistant submit lần đầu

```txt
Open assigned task
→ Start task
→ Upload work file
→ Add note optional/required tùy task
→ Submit
→ Task.status = SUBMITTED
→ Submission.status = SUBMITTED
→ Notify Mangaka
```

## Required validation

```txt
At least one work file
Task is assigned to current Assistant
Task status is IN_PROGRESS or REVISION_REQUESTED
Submission is not already submitted
File type allowed
File size allowed
```

## Sau khi submit

Assistant UI hiển thị:

```txt
Waiting Mangaka review
Submitted at {time}
Current submission version: v1/v2/v3
```

Disable submit tiếp cho tới khi có revision request hoặc task được reopen.

---

# 13. Revision flow

Khi Mangaka hoặc Editor request changes:

```txt
Task.status = REVISION_REQUESTED
Current submission.status = REVISION_REQUESTED
Feedback required
Assistant receives notification
```

Assistant action:

```txt
Open task
→ Read feedback
→ Upload revised work
→ Submit new version
→ Task.status = SUBMITTED
→ New Submission.status = SUBMITTED
```

UI nên hiển thị rõ:

```txt
Revision requested
Reviewer feedback
Previous submission
Upload revised version
```

Không sửa đè file version cũ.

