# 15. Rejected / Cancelled states

## Rejected

```txt
Task.status = REJECTED
```

Assistant thấy:

```txt
Task rejected
Reason / feedback
Read-only
```

Không tự resubmit nếu task đã rejected, trừ khi Mangaka/Editor tạo task mới.

## Cancelled

```txt
Task.status = CANCELLED
```

Assistant thấy:

```txt
Task cancelled
Reason if available
Read-only
```

Cancelled task không tạo earning.

---

# 16. Earning visibility for Assistant

Assistant earning chỉ sinh khi:

```txt
Task.status = EDITOR_APPROVED
```

Không sinh earning khi:

```txt
Task.status = SUBMITTED
Task.status = MANGAKA_APPROVED
Task.status = REVISION_REQUESTED
```

## AssistantEarning status

```ts
type AssistantEarningStatus =
  | "PENDING"
  | "CONFIRMED"
  | "PAID"
  | "VOID";
```

Assistant UI nên hiển thị:

```txt
Pending earning
Confirmed earning
Paid
Void / cancelled
```

Assistant chỉ thấy earning của mình, không thấy earning của assistant khác.

