# 19. File upload / submission asset

Assistant submission files nên lưu tách với manuscript/page production files.

R2 path đề xuất:

```txt
series/{seriesSlug}-{seriesShortId}/chapters/ch{chapterNumber}-{chapterShortId}/tasks/{taskShortId}/submissions/v{submissionVersion}-{submissionShortId}/{assetType}/{fileAssetShortId}.{ext}
```

Ví dụ:

```txt
series/one-piece-6856a1/chapters/ch13-6860c1/tasks/cleaning-68d2a1/submissions/v1-68d3b2/work-file/68d3c3.png
series/one-piece-6856a1/chapters/ch13-6860c1/tasks/cleaning-68d2a1/submissions/v2-68d4b9/work-file/68d4c1.png
```

Asset type gợi ý:

```ts
type SubmissionAssetType =
  | "work_file"
  | "preview"
  | "reference"
  | "other";
```

Không dùng chung folder với manuscript proposal.

